<title>USA: CS First Boston unit files for $300mln shelf debt.</title>
<headline>CS First Boston unit files for $300mln shelf debt.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston Mortgage Securities Corp, a unit of CS First Boston, filed Thursday with the Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf registration for up to $300 million in conduit mortage pass-through certificates.</p>
<p>The offering will be made through CS First Boston.</p>
</text>
